white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           西达玛 Arbegona 咖啡产区距离 Gedeo 省府城市 Dilla 约 100 公里，和相邻的 Bensa 咖啡\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           产区因 CoE 连续多年取得佳绩而闻名。该产区年降雨量约 2100 毫米，年平均气温 14-\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           23 度。本次获奖的 ToH 蜜处理咖啡来自 Arbegona下的小镇 Duwancho，该村落下辖 213 家\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           咖啡农户，除了种植咖啡树外，还种植有香蕉、竹子、百香果等作物。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFre4yDQXRbyfO88RMb4KGxLaFlkF8ZqZ1FW7YCmVK0zLqIxxD8HiaicZYA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Duwancho 咖啡处理站最初由居住 Arbegona 小镇周边 Duwancho, Rumudamo, Bochesa 和\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Shamatanto 四个村庄的咖啡农合作社于 2019 年建立，所有的村庄都曾种植着一种名为\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Duwancho 的本土植物俗称水莓树，因此合作社也可以称之为水莓合作社（我们音译为杜婉丘是为了和其他的处理站音译一致）。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFricd2vPsNjmHDtQTly19gbI82fdzuA7xV5BxGnrGMT5bWMOv7kiaKm8Qw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           合作社从\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           2021 年与 Yihonal 建立战略合作伙伴关系后，在合作社内建造了新的办公室、仓库、咖啡\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           干燥床，并购买了更多用于扩建处理站的土地，从而形成了现在规模的 Duwancho 咖啡\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span>\n           处理站，目前处理站主要制作传统的日晒、厌氧日晒和蜜处理等咖啡豆。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n             关于水洗批次处理\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n            Duwancho的水洗处理相比其它的水洗处理可能的差异是，鲜果是当天采收鲜果，当天脱皮，即所谓的Day Lot；然后脱皮后2天的加水（湿）发酵中每24小时换一次水；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n            公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n            客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
